comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-29T18:36:28.110Z",codex-agent,Read-only audit found the prepared 2026.10.29 ahead of npm with no tag or matching changelog section. Verified merged delivery PRs and successful release CI. Their owning items remain in_progress. Append-only pinned CLI lifecycle and release updates are explicitly authorized for recovery; unrelated open follow-ups remain open.
  "2026-10-29T18:55:50.543Z",codex-agent,"Recovery closes only the verified deliveries in merged PRs 164 and 166, pins 2026.10.29 and regenerates the exact dated section with the repository command. Linked npm run changelog:check passes 1/1; origin/main lacks the heading and the repaired metadata makes the same generator include it. Source, version, dependency pins and workflows are unchanged. Fresh npm/Bun full release gates remain required at unchanged thresholds in CI."
